{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28083","headline":"明月照高楼 · 雍陶","name":"明月照高楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朗月何高高，楼中帘影寒。\n一妇独含叹，四坐谁成欢。\n时节屡已移，游旅杳不还。\n沧溟傥未涸，妾泪终不乾。\n君若无定云，妾若不动山。\n云行出山易，山逐云去难。\n愿爲边塞尘，因风委君颜。\n君颜良洗多，荡妾浊水间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28083.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28083","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}